<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91I\'92m Dr John,\'92 he said. \'91This is my one of my entourage, Dr Nick.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Hello,\'92 Sarah mumbled an rearrange her bed hair which, Dr John noted, was still very fetching nonetheless.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Dr John was clad in what appeared to be a mashup between a cotton long-sleeved doctor\'92s coat and a karate 
\f3\i keiko-gi
\f1\i0 . His hair was perfect in the late \'9260s casual style: layered and feathered; brushed not combed; matt, rather than glossy, from careful use of liquid wax and texture powder; with a slightly disobedient fringe and perfectly sculptured lamb-chops that spoke of a moderate, yet conservative rule-breaker.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>As Dr John sat diagonally one-cheeked on the bed, Dr Nick, a passably well-dressed Cloudborne, stood back apace in Dr John\'92s shadow, obscured mostly from Sarah. \
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Dr John gently held Sarah\'92s chin and peered into her eyes. \'91I understand you\'92ve been experiencing some nausea, headaches, vomiting?\'92\
