<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Are you autistic?\'92 asked Dr John, becoming stern.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'92No?\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Good. We of the Change of Habit Series are not good with autism.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Sarah scrunched her nose, as if it might crystallise some clarity out of her confusion.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91You don\'92t have alpha-1-antitrypsin deficiency, do you?\'92\
